#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32U5 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32U5 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (U535, U545, U575, U585, U595, U5A5, U5A9, U5F7, U5F9, U5G7, U5G9)
